s know how it feels, and if anything is confusing, unexpected, or needs improving. In addition to the major contr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T19:17:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783575379","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410710-1834602721201693","game_id":"steam-4410710","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for over 5,000 wishlists!","summary":"Thank you so much to everyone who has played the Fields of Aaru demo, wishlisted, reviewed, reported issues, shared feedback, or supported us. Every wishlist, review, comment, and bug report is very much appreciated! We've been working hard on a set of fixes and improvements for the demo since it launched just a few days ago, and we're happy to have the first patch out now! The update includes new safer first-run graphics defaults, a reduced texture quality option for lower-end systems and integ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T13:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201693","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410710-1834602721200960","game_id":"steam-4410710","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #1: Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hey everyone, Thanks to all of you who sent in crash reports, shared feedback, or let us know when something wasn't working properly! We've pushed a couple of small demo updates. Here are the notes for the latest fixes and improvements! Demo Update NotesAdded automatic first-run graphics defaults to help lower-end systems choose safer settings.Added a Reduced Texture Quality graphics option, which can lower memory usage by around 40% and should help the demo run better on integrated GPUs and low","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T07:01:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410710-1834602721189040","game_id":"steam-4410710","kind":"announcement","title":"Fields of Aaru Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Hey everyone! We're super excited to announce that the Fields of Aaru demo is officially live on Steam! You can watch the official demo launch trailer here:In the Fields of Aaru demo, you'll be able to explore the early areas along the Nile. Settle into Aaru, meet the villagers, and begin restoring the town. Farm, fish, and gather resources. Plant your first crops, fish along the riverbanks, and start building up your home in the afterlife. Help restore the village. Complete tasks for villagers,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T00:03:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410710-1834602721185383","game_id":"steam-4410710","kind":"announcement","title":"Fields of Aaru x Women-Led Games x Summer Game Fest","summary":"Hi everyone! We have some really exciting news!!! Fields of Aaru will be part of ☀️Women-Led Games x Summer Game Fest☀️ on June 4 at 4 PM PT, 7 PM ET!As part of the show, we'll be premiering an exclusive new gameplay trailer… and we'll have another very exciting announcement alongside it. We can't say more just yet, but if you've been waiting to spend time in Aaru, tune in for the showcase😄 Finally, if you missed our previous announcement, we've opened a Fields of Aaru community Discord: 🔗 https","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185383","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410710-1832700592799459","game_id":"steam-4410710","kind":"announcement","title":"Fields of Aaru Discord Invitation","summary":"We've just opened the official community Fields of Aaru Discord: https://discord.com/invite/7FQSutvEJw 🌎 We wanted somewhere a little more direct where we can share updates and start building a small community around Fields of Aaru. You can keep up with development, see what we're working on, and chat with other people following the game. 🧪 We'll also be using it for some early testing, so it's a good place to be if you'd like to be part of that! If Discord isn't your thing, no worries. We'll st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T20:21:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592799459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4410710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4410710":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4410710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4665870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4410710","app_id":4410710,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","bat